  {
   "id": "timemelters-210869@post-2024-07-09",
   "gameId": "timemelters-210869",
   "displayName": "Small bug fixes, balancing tweaks, and cross platform support",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2024-07-09T17:14:15.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We hope your summer is off to a fantastic start and that you're making the most of the Steam Summer Sale! We're thrilled to announce that TimeMelters will launch on PS5 on July 11th, and we've been working tirelessly to make it happen. The porting process has been an incredible journey, and doing it all in-house has taught us a lot, resulting in improved optimization on PC as well.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5",
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "We're excited to share that the co-op mode will now feature cross-platform play with PS5, and you'll be able to use the PC Friend's Pass too! So, if you have friends on PC or PS5 who haven't tried the game yet, now is the perfect time to let them know.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5",
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "The update includes bug fixes, further optimizations, and balance tweaks. Stay tuned for more updates, and thank you for your continued support!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Cheers!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
