  {
   "id": "timemelters-210869@hotfix-2024-04-16",
   "gameId": "timemelters-210869",
   "displayName": "Spanish language update and hotfix!",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-04-16T18:00:21.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey everyone, we are releasing a hot fix for TimeMelters today that also includes the Spanish language update!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "There were a few issues that sprung up on us that needed some quick addressing, but we decided to also include a few features and bug fixes that were ready for an upcoming patch. The Patch notes are:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The final video at the end of the game sometimes played more than once",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "People running Windows 11 and a duel monitor set up where running into issues with the mouse losing focus, or not being able to click on anything",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "We fixed a few small bugs in the challenges",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We added the name of the coop player in certain areas of the game",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added Spanish language option",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added up and down mouse wheel sensitivity for Spirit Sight",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "new",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Other minor bugs and optimizations",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We're up to 78 reviews on Steam with a 93% Positive rating, which is incredible. We also happened to be one of the top 10 rated games in 2024 with a Metacritic of 89!! We almost can't even believe it. So thank you all for the overwhelming support, and we will continue to making TimeMelters as good a game as it can be leading up to this console launch later this years.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
