  {
   "id": "timemelters-210869@1.1",
   "gameId": "timemelters-210869",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.1",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-03-21T17:06:32.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey all, we hope you've been enjoying the post 1.0 launch as much as we have! There are a lot of great reviews coming in, which is incredible. It's also a lot of fun for us to see people playing, understanding and having fun while exploring TimeMelters.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We already have a post game patch that is ready to go live, mainly fixing a few little bugs here and there:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Buffed the Fire Storm perk, increasing the shots from a Fire Spirit on an Orb.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added a ping icon for user feedback when you right click in coop",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added a video that shows REDACTED in Clawdenvale",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug with the horizontal/vertical mouse sensitivity",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a coop/controller bug, it would vibrate when it wasn't suppose to",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug where the player couldn't move after summoning the void spirit",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where videos would randomly stop playing properly",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug where players would still have a bit of agony mana left but could not use it",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Increased mana in strategist in Kamorr",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a coop bug when the client player uses spirit blast right when they rewind time",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug in the solo campaign where the first Community Challenge was still locked after playing Lancestorm",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug with the sky in Elfarness",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug with some particles FX that would not scale properly",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed bugs with some vegetation assets",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Rebalanced a few challenges",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed other minor bugs/issues",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Minor optimizations",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We wanted to get this patch out fast to fix some of these issues that popped up after launch, and we're happy with how quickly we were able to turn this around. Going forward, we are working on adding Spanish text to the game!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you all again, TimeMelters wouldn't be where it is now without all of your help. We truly appreciate it more than you can ever know,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The AutoExec team",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
